    "reasoning_cat1": "The catch-alls \"and other means\" and \"other risks usually associated with such travel\" sit against long enumerated lists, which is the classic general-vs-specific setup, but since the clause is descriptive no right or duty depends on the catch-all's reach. Embedded page-footer OCR debris interrupts the sentence without changing meaning.",
