    "reasoning_cat1": "\"Forces of nature\" and \"other mild or serious conditions\" are open-ended catch-alls after enumerated specifics, but the provision is descriptive and no obligation hinges on the boundary. Nothing here a court would need to define.",
    "reasoning_cat2": "It feeds directly into the assumed risks in c016 and is not in tension with the release in c017. No relational defect.",
    "prob_cat1": 0.07,
